","separable":true,"reflexive":false,"government":"Akkusativ"},"collocations":["Ware zurückgeben","eine Flasche zurückgeben"],"learning_note":"分離動詞なので現在形では zurück が文末に来ます。","related_terms":["umtauschen","zurückbringen"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"a1-021","lemma":"Unterschrift","display_de":"die Unterschrift","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"A2","level_tags":["A2"],"topic_tags":["administration","外国人局・役所","housing","住まい"],"scene_tags":["administration","housing"],"japanese":"署名","example_de":"Hier fehlt noch Ihre Unterschrift.","example_ja":"ここにまだ署名が必要です。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Unterschriften"},"collocations":["eine Unterschrift leisten","hier unterschreiben"],"learning_note":"日常会話では名詞より動詞 unterschreiben もよく使います。","related_terms":["unterschreiben","der Vertrag"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"a1-022","lemma":"sich anmelden","display_de":"sich anmelden","unit_type":"phrase","part_of_speech":"verb","primary_level":"A2","level_tags":["A2"],"topic_tags":["administration","外国人局・役所"],"scene_tags":["administration"],"japanese":"登録する、住民登録をする","example_de":"Ich möchte mich in Düsseldorf anmelden.","example_ja":"デュッセルドルフで住民登録をしたいです。","grammar":{"third_person":"meldet sich an","past_participle":"angemeldet","auxiliary":"haben","separable":true,"reflexive":true,"government":"sich (Akkusativ) anmelden; bei + Dativ / für + Akkusativ"},"collocations":["sich beim Bürgeramt anmelden","einen Wohnsitz anmelden"],"learning_note":"人が登録する場合は再帰形、住所を登録する場合は einen Wohnsitz anmelden とします。","related_terms":["die Anmeldung","abmelden"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"a1-029","lemma":"Schmerzen","display_de":"die Schmerzen","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"A2","level_tags":["A2"],"topic_tags":["medical","病院・薬局"],"scene_tags":["medical"],"japanese":"痛み","example_de":"Ich habe seit gestern starke Schmerzen.","example_ja":"昨日から強い痛みがあります。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"通常は複数形 Schmerzen; 単数 Schmerz も可"},"collocations":["Schmerzen haben","starke Schmerzen"],"learning_note":"痛みを訴えるときは Ich habe Schmerzen. と複数形をよく使います。","related_terms":["weh tun","der Schmerz"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"a1-030","lemma":"Rezept","display_de":"das Rezept","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"A2","level_tags":["A2"],"topic_tags":["medical","病院・薬局"],"scene_tags":["medical"],"japanese":"処方箋、レシピ","example_de":"Ich habe ein Rezept vom Arzt.","example_ja":"医師から処方箋をもらっています。","grammar":{"article":"das","plural":"Rezepte"},"collocations":["ein Rezept einlösen","ein Rezept bekommen"],"learning_note":"医療の文脈では処方箋、料理ではレシピという意味です。","related_terms":["das E-Rezept","das Medikament"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"a1-032","lemma":"einnehmen","display_de":"einnehmen","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"verb","primary_level":"A2","level_tags":["A2"],"topic_tags":["medical","病院・薬局"],"scene_tags":["medical"],"japanese":"（薬を）服用する","example_de":"Wie soll ich das Medikament einnehmen?","example_ja":"この薬はどう服用すればよいですか。","grammar":{"third_person":"nimmt ein","past_participle":"eingenommen","auxiliary":"haben","separable":true,"reflexive":false,"government":"Akkusativ"},"collocations":["ein Medikament einnehmen","vor dem Essen einnehmen"],"learning_note":"分離動詞です。食前は vor dem Essen、食後は nach dem Essen。","related_terms":["nehmen","die Dosierung"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"a1-034","lemma":"Miete","display_de":"die Miete","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"A2","level_tags":["A2"],"topic_tags":["housing","住まい"],"scene_tags":["housing"],"japanese":"家賃","example_de":"Die Miete ist am Monatsanfang fällig.","example_ja":"家賃は月初に支払期限です。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Mieten"},"collocations":["Miete zahlen","die monatliche Miete"],"learning_note":"賃貸物件そのものは Wohnung、支払う家賃は Miete です。","related_terms":["die Kaltmiete","die Nebenkosten"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"a1-037","lemma":"Heizung","display_de":"die Heizung","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"A2","level_tags":["A2"],"topic_tags":["housing","住まい"],"scene_tags":["housing"],"japanese":"暖房設備","example_de":"Die Heizung wird nicht warm.","example_ja":"暖房が暖かくなりません。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Heizungen"},"collocations":["die Heizung einschalten","die Heizung reparieren"],"learning_note":"暖房が効かないときは wird nicht warm が具体的で自然です。","related_terms":["der Heizkörper","warm"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"a1-038","lemma":"Vermieter","display_de":"der Vermieter","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"A2","level_tags":["A2"],"topic_tags":["housing","住まい"],"scene_tags":["housing"],"japanese":"男性の大家、賃貸人","example_de":"Ich rufe den Vermieter an.","example_ja":"大家に電話します。","grammar":{"article":"der","plural":"Vermieter"},"collocations":["den Vermieter informieren","mit dem Vermieter sprechen"],"learning_note":"管理会社の場合は Hausverwaltung を使います。","related_terms":["die Vermieterin","der Mieter"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"a1-039","lemma":"Vermieterin","display_de":"die Vermieterin","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"A2","level_tags":["A2"],"topic_tags":["housing","住まい"],"scene_tags":["housing"],"japanese":"女性の大家、賃貸人","example_de":"Die Vermieterin kommt am Freitag vorbei.","example_ja":"大家は金曜日に立ち寄ります。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Vermieterinnen"},"collocations":["die Vermieterin kontaktieren","der Vermieterin schreiben"],"learning_note":"schreiben の相手は3格なので der Vermieterin になります。","related_terms":["der Vermieter","die Hausverwaltung"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"a1-043","lemma":"abholen","display_de":"abholen","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"verb","primary_level":"A2","level_tags":["A2"],"topic_tags":["kita-school","Kita・学校","daily","日常"],"scene_tags":["kita-school","daily"],"japanese":"迎えに行く、受け取る","example_